# Walk the dependency map, read an item and come back, then link and unlink a
# dependency through its overlays.
mask /Created: [A-Z][a-z]+ (\d\d, \d{4}|\d, \d{4} ?)/ "Created: <date>"

wait Export posts from the old CMS
press T
wait All trees
frame forest

press l
wait i flip
frame focus-pane
press i
wait Tree — unblocks
frame flipped
press i
wait Tree — waits on

press enter
wait Blocked by
frame read-an-item
press esc
wait All trees
frame back-in-the-tree
press h
press esc
wait All trees

press tab
wait /(?m)^.*Projects/
press l
wait c complete
press b
wait Link dependency for: Export posts from the old CMS (1)
frame link-overlay
press /
type faucet
wait > faucet
wait Buy the faucet
frame link-overlay-filtered
press enter
press enter
wait Dependency linked
wait blocked by: Replace the
frame linked

press B
wait Unlink dependency from: Export posts from the old CMS (1)
frame unlink-overlay
press enter
gone blocked by: Replace the

press q
exits
